      "writtenOn": "2023-04-06T22:33:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is reclaiming and freeing memory not allocated by this function. trusty_free_sched_share will also try to free this again. You either need to move the allocation here, or remove this. If you remove this cleanup though, you need to add some new state to tell trusty_unregister_sched_share if it needs to do anything.",
